---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Hero from '../components/home/Hero.astro';
import TrustBar from '../components/home/TrustBar.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import bisou from '../assets/realisations/bisou-vole-home.jpg';
import kmm from '../assets/realisations/kmm-terminal.png';
---
<Base>
<Hero />
<TrustBar />

<!-- ══ PROCESS ══ -->
<section id="process">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="proc-giant-wrap rv">
      <h2 class="giant-h">Un process clair,<br>en 4 étapes</h2>
      <p class="sec-p">On avance étape par étape : vous savez ce qu'on fait, pourquoi on le fait, et ce qui vient ensuite.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="proc-list">
      <div class="proc-step">
        <span class="ps-num" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        <div class="ps-t rv-l">
          <div class="ps-n">» étape 01</div>
          <h3>On cadre le vrai problème</h3>
          <p>Un échange direct avec moi, sans formulaire à rallonge ni chef de projet en relais : on cerne ce que l'outil doit résoudre, concrètement.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ps-c rv-r">
          <div class="cw">
            <div class="cw-bar"><div class="cw-d"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><span class="cw-f">brief-salon.md</span></div>
            <div class="cw-b"><code><span class="cm"># Brief — salon de coiffure</span>
<span class="ky">problème</span>   <span class="op">:</span> <span class="st">gestion 100% par téléphone</span>
<span class="ky">objectif</span>   <span class="op">:</span> <span class="st">réservation en ligne, zéro appel</span>
<span class="ky">contrainte</span> <span class="op">:</span> <span class="st">aucune formation nécessaire</span></code></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="proc-step">
        <span class="ps-num" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        <div class="ps-t rv-r">
          <div class="ps-n">» étape 02</div>
          <h3>On pose les fondations</h3>
          <p>Architecture des données, choix techniques, parcours utilisateur : ce travail en amont évite les refontes en cours de route et vous fait gagner du temps et de l'argent.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ps-c rv-l">
          <div class="cw">
            <div class="cw-bar"><div class="cw-d"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><span class="cw-f">schema.sql</span></div>
            <div class="cw-b"><code><span class="kw">create table</span> <span class="fn">reservations</span> <span class="pu">(</span>
  <span class="ky">id</span><span class="pu">,</span>        <span class="nm">uuid</span> <span class="kw">primary key</span><span class="pu">,</span>
  <span class="ky">client_id</span><span class="pu">,</span> <span class="nm">uuid</span> <span class="kw">references</span> <span class="fn">clients</span><span class="pu">,</span>
  <span class="ky">creneau</span><span class="pu">,</span>   <span class="nm">timestamptz</span><span class="pu">,</span>
  <span class="ky">statut</span><span class="pu">,</span>    <span class="nm">text</span> <span class="kw">default</span> <span class="st">'confirmé'</span>
<span class="pu">);</span></code></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="proc-step">
        <span class="ps-num" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
        <div class="ps-t rv-l">
          <div class="ps-n">» étape 03</div>
          <h3>On construit, sur mesure</h3>
          <p>Chaque ligne de code existe pour votre cas précis — pas de template ajusté à la va-vite, pas de fonctionnalité superflue.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ps-c rv-r">
          <div class="cw">
            <div class="cw-bar"><div class="cw-d"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><span class="cw-f">ReservationGrid.tsx</span></div>
            <div class="cw-b"><code><span class="kw">export default function</span> <span class="fn">ReservationGrid</span><span class="pu">() &#123;</span>
  <span class="kw">const</span> <span class="pu">&#123;</span> <span class="fn">creneaux</span> <span class="pu">&#125;</span> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fn">useReservations</span><span class="pu">(&#123;</span>
    <span class="ky">jour</span><span class="op">:</span> <span class="kw">today</span>
  <span class="pu">&#125;)</span>
  <span class="kw">return</span> <span class="op">&lt;</span><span class="fn">Planning</span> <span class="ky">creneaux</span><span class="op">=</span><span class="pu">&#123;</span><span class="fn">creneaux</span><span class="pu">&#125;</span> <span class="op">/&gt;</span>
<span class="pu">&#125;</span></code></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="proc-step">
        <span class="ps-num" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
        <div class="ps-t rv-r">
          <div class="ps-n">» étape 04</div>
          <h3>On livre, et on reste joignable</h3>
          <p>Mise en production, prise en main, maintenance dans la durée. Un numéro direct après la livraison — pas un ticket de support.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ps-c rv-l">
          <div class="cw">
            <div class="cw-bar"><div class="cw-d"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><span class="cw-f">livraison.log</span></div>
            <div class="cw-b"><code><span class="cm">✓ build terminé — 0 erreur</span>
<span class="cm">✓ déployé sur polowagency.fr</span>
<span class="cm">✓ formation client planifiée</span>
<span class="fn">→</span> <span class="st">"Un contact direct, pas un ticket."</span></code></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ RÉALISATIONS ══ -->
<section id="realisations">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="work-head rv" style="text-align:center;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto 3.5rem">
      <span class="chip">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18M9 21V9"/></svg>
        Nos réalisations
      </span>
      <h2 class="sec-h">Des vrais commerces,<br><em>de vrais outils.</em></h2>
      <p class="sec-p">Pas de maquette figée : des produits en production, chacun construit autour d'un problème métier précis.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="work-card rv d2">
      <a class="work-shot" href="https://bisouvole.fr" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Voir bisouvole.fr">
        <div class="cw work-cw">
          <div class="cw-bar"><div class="cw-d"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><span class="cw-f">bisouvole.fr</span></div>
          <div class="cw-b">
            <Image src={bisou} alt="Page d'accueil du site Bisou Volé, salon de coiffure du Vieux Lille à Lille" widths={[480, 800, 1200]} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 640px" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>
      <div class="work-info">
        <span class="work-tag">Site vitrine + réservation en ligne</span>
        <h3>Bisou Volé</h3>
        <p>Le salon de coiffure de Valentin Rico, dans le Vieux Lille. Contenu sur mesure, prise de rendez-vous intégrée, fiche établissement optimisée pour le référencement local.</p>
        <div class="work-meta">
          <div class="work-meta-item"><span class="work-meta-l">Client</span><span class="work-meta-v">Valentin Rico</span></div>
          <div class="work-meta-item"><span class="work-meta-l">Lieu</span><span class="work-meta-v">Vieux Lille</span></div>
          <div class="work-meta-item"><span class="work-meta-l">Prestation</span><span class="work-meta-v">Site + réservation</span></div>
        </div>
        <a class="work-link" href="https://bisouvole.fr" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span>Voir bisouvole.fr</span>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="work-card work-card-rev rv d2">
      <a class="work-shot" href="https://kmmterminal.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Voir kmmterminal.com">
        <div class="cw work-cw">
          <div class="cw-bar"><div class="cw-d"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><span class="cw-f">kmmterminal.com</span></div>
          <div class="cw-b">
            <Image src={kmm} alt="Le Terminal KMM, tableau de bord d'analyse temps réel des futures Gold" widths={[480, 800, 1200]} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 640px" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>
      <div class="work-info">
        <span class="work-tag">Application SaaS + formation</span>
        <h3>KMM Trade Hub</h3>
        <p>Un terminal d'analyse temps réel des futures Gold (données CME) couplé à une formation et une communauté privée, pour apprendre à trader avec méthode.</p>
        <div class="work-meta">
          <div class="work-meta-item"><span class="work-meta-l">Client</span><span class="work-meta-v">Kevin</span></div>
          <div class="work-meta-item"><span class="work-meta-l">Marché</span><span class="work-meta-v">Futures Gold</span></div>
          <div class="work-meta-item"><span class="work-meta-l">Prestation</span><span class="work-meta-v">Terminal + formation</span></div>
        </div>
        <a class="work-link" href="https://kmmterminal.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span>Voir kmmterminal.com</span>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ TESTIMONIALS ══ -->
<section id="testimonials">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="testi-head rv">
      <span class="chip">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
        Ce qu'ils en disent
      </span>
      <h2 class="sec-h">Des clients qui avancent,<br><em>des projets qui durent</em></h2>
      <p class="sec-p">Quelques retours de fondateurs et gérants qui nous ont confié leurs outils digitaux.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="testi-marquee">
      <!-- TRACK 1 → gauche -->
      <div class="testi-track testi-track-1">
        <!-- original -->
        <div class="testi-card">
          <div class="testi-stars"><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg></div>
          <p class="testi-quote">Paul a créé notre système de réservation en 3 semaines. Avant, on gérait tout par appel. Aujourd'hui 60 % des RDV arrivent sans qu'on décroche le téléphone.</p>
          <div class="testi-author"><div class="testi-av">KB</div><div><div class="testi-name">Karim B.</div><div class="testi-role">Gérant, salon de coiffure · Paris</div></div><span class="testi-tag">Réservation en ligne</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="testi-card">
          <div class="testi-stars"><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg></div>
          <p class="testi-quote">On voulait un espace client pour que nos membres réservent leurs séances. C'est exactement ce qu'on a eu — sans les fonctions inutiles des grosses plateformes.</p>
          <div class="testi-author"><div class="testi-av">SM</div><div><div class="testi-name">Sophie M.</div><div class="testi-role">Co-fondatrice, studio pilates · Lyon</div></div><span class="testi-tag">App membres</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="testi-card">
          <div class="testi-stars"><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg></div>
          <p class="testi-quote">Notre CRM sur mesure nous fait économiser 2h de saisie par jour. Le ROI a été immédiat dès le premier mois. Il fait exactement ce dont on a besoin — rien de plus.</p>
          <div class="testi-author"><div class="testi-av">TR</div><div><div class="testi-name">Thomas R.</div><div class="testi-role">Directeur commercial, BTP · Bordeaux</div></div><span class="testi-tag">CRM sur mesure</span></div>
        </div>
        <!-- duplicate for seamless loop -->
        <div class="testi-card">
          <div class="testi-stars"><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg></div>
          <p class="testi-quote">Paul a créé notre système de réservation en 3 semaines. Avant, on gérait tout par appel. Aujourd'hui 60 % des RDV arrivent sans qu'on décroche le téléphone.</p>
          <div class="testi-author"><div class="testi-av">KB</div><div><div class="testi-name">Karim B.</div><div class="testi-role">Gérant, salon de coiffure · Paris</div></div><span class="testi-tag">Réservation en ligne</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="testi-card">
          <div class="testi-stars"><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg></div>
          <p class="testi-quote">On voulait un espace client pour que nos membres réservent leurs séances. C'est exactement ce qu'on a eu — sans les fonctions inutiles des grosses plateformes.</p>
          <div class="testi-author"><div class="testi-av">SM</div><div><div class="testi-name">Sophie M.</div><div class="testi-role">Co-fondatrice, studio pilates · Lyon</div></div><span class="testi-tag">App membres</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="testi-card">
          <div class="testi-stars"><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg></div>
          <p class="testi-quote">Notre CRM sur mesure nous fait économiser 2h de saisie par jour. Le ROI a été immédiat dès le premier mois. Il fait exactement ce dont on a besoin — rien de plus.</p>
          <div class="testi-author"><div class="testi-av">TR</div><div><div class="testi-name">Thomas R.</div><div class="testi-role">Directeur commercial, BTP · Bordeaux</div></div><span class="testi-tag">CRM sur mesure</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- TRACK 2 → droite -->
      <div class="testi-track testi-track-2">
        <!-- original -->
        <div class="testi-card">
          <div class="testi-stars"><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg><svg class="testi-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg></div>
          <p class="testi-quote">Site livré en 2 semaines, propre, rapide, et qui convertit vraiment. J'ai eu 4 prospects qualifiés dès la première semaine de mise en ligne. Zéro friction dans les échanges.</p>
          <div class="testi-author"><div class="testi-av">AD</div><div><div class="testi-name">Amina D.</div><div class="testi-role">Consultante RH indépendante · Nantes</div></div><span class="testi-tag">Site vitrine</span></div>
