        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2l3 7h7l-5.5 4 2 7L12 16l-6.5 4 2-7L2 9h7z"/></svg>
        Notre vision
      </span>
